  unitName: Fire Crystal
  unitId: 10344
  unitNumber: 429
  description: This magical creature is said to systemize and store all Fire-related
    knowledge that Metal Units can hold within them. They may look gentle, but they
    are known for mercilessly criticizing anyone and everyone. Even the cynical Fire
    Ghosts get nervous and speechless around them. Though their harsh words may sound
    insulting at first, listen calmly and they insightful opinions on how to amend
    faults for the better. If you ever feel lost in life, you might want to seek
    one out.
  summonDesc: So you're a Summoner!<br>What's with that slack face!<br>Looks like
    I'll have to teach you!
